{
  "name": "consumables",
  "normalizations": [
    "Drink a potion of healing after 6 damage and a potion of harming, comparing health and the glass bottle each leaves.",
    "Drink milk while under speed, leaving a bucket, and eat a mushroom stew once hunger has lowered the food level, leaving a bowl.",
    "Use matching flat terrain with natural spawning and regeneration off."
